  "problem": "",
  "worked_solution": "We have\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}\\sqrt[3]{2}\\cdot \\sqrt{8}\\cdot \\sqrt[3]{2}\\cdot \\sqrt{8}\\cdot \\sqrt[3]{2} & = \\\\ (\\sqrt[3]{2}\\cdot \\sqrt[3]{2}\\cdot \\sqrt[3]{2})(\\sqrt{8}\\cdot \\sqrt{8}) & = \\\\ {(\\sqrt[3]{2})}^{3}{(\\sqrt{8})}^{2} & = \\\\ 2\\cdot 8 & = \\\\ 16 & .\\end{aligned}\n$$",
